{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24033","headline":"代鹤 · 白居易","name":"代鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我本海上鹤，偶逢江南客。\n感君一顾恩，同来洛阳陌。\n洛阳寡族类，皎皎唯两翼。\n貌是天与高，色非日浴白。\n主人诚可恋，其奈轩庭窄。\n饮啄杂鸡羣，年深损标格。\n故乡渺何处，云水重重隔。\n谁念深笼中，七换摩天翮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}